## DESIGN SYSTEM INTEL (UI/UX PRO MAX)
- Location: .cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/
- Whenever modifying or creating HTML files, verify structural hierarchy against the rules in 'ui-reasoning.csv'.
- Canonical brand docs: `docs/brand-guidelines.md`, `docs/marketing-guidelines.md`, `design-system/MASTER.md`, `design-system/tokens.json`.
- Enforce the following strict boundaries for Equinox AV Quiet Room (v2.1):
  * Primary Style: Premium Service Minimalism / Quiet Room (bone canvas, ink type — not dark mode).
  * Typography: Newsreader headers + Inter Tight body + JetBrains Mono meta. No Fraunces/Playfair swaps.
  * Spatial Rule: Tiered spacing — `--space-7` (10rem) default section padding; `--space-8` / 15rem Max Breath for signature sections only; 6rem top after full-bleed heroes.
  * Animation: Global cross-document view transitions locked at 350ms.
  * CTA: "Start a project" sitewide (never "Get a Quote").
- ANTI-PATTERNS TO ENFORCE (SILENTLY ABORT IF DETECTED):
  * No trend-chasing visual clutter (No neumorphism or heavy gradient meshes).
  * No generic "AI Indigo" or purple-to-pink highlights.
  * No legacy orange/navy/electric-blue palette on new work.
  * No emojis used as standalone icons; always use crisp semantic SVGs.
  * No layout shifts; ensure image containers have explicit aspect ratios or width parameters.
  * No stacked logo medallion in heroes; nav wordmark is ink-on-bone.

---

# Equinox Audio Visuals — Project Rules

This is a static, multi-page marketing site (vanilla HTML/CSS/JS, no build step).
Design tokens live in `stable-header.css` `:root`; v2 component styles live in
`design-system-v2.css` and are scoped to `.v2` on `<body>`.

When making design or layout changes, consult `docs/brand-guidelines.md` first,
then the DESIGN SYSTEM INTEL block above and `.cursor/skills/ui-ux-pro-max/`.
